  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for fluent metric-measurement assertions over System.Diagnostics.Metrics instruments in .NET test projects, built on the first-party MetricCollector testing primitive. Captures the measurements an instrument records into a disposable, per-test InstrumentCapture and projects them to a uniform CapturedMeasurement shape, with meter-wide, observable, by-name and per-flow capture, and tag and delta queries. Test-framework assertion entry points live in adapter packages (MetricsAssertions.TUnit). AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection.",
  "id": "MetricsAssertions",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T06:19:05.343Z",
